          "entry_id": 2980,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4719097,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2975,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4035352,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2989,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.34955624,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, and a staff member may join a conversation to help you. Do not use the chat to report a medical emergency: call 911 or go to the nearest emergency department.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2984,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.34904328,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n\nSome tests are done at the clinic during a regular appointment. This guide explains how to prepare for each of them. If your doctor has given you different instructions, follow those instead.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.3244592,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Changing your phone number or email address\n\nTell the front desk at check-in, or update the contact section of Form PR-1 at the self-check-in kiosk. Reminders are sent to the phone number we hold when the reminder goes out.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.32200733,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.3202855,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank details, Social Security number or insurance member ID by text message",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2981,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3038783,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2989,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.30335814,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who han",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.28157565,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Bringing someone with you\n\nYou may bring one adult companion into the consulting room. Anyone else who comes with you can wait in the waiting area.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2771262,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always c",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2987,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.27087724,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Email\n\nWe use email only to confirm a new appointment and to send an itemized receipt you have asked for. We do not send test results or medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2989,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.26468447,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Questions and complaints about privacy\n\nOur privacy officer answers questions about how your information is used and handles privacy complaints. Ask the f",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2990,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.26269922,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medical examinations, pilot medicals or immigration medical examinations. A",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2982,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.26094913,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Cigna\n\nWe are in-network with Cigna Open Access Plus (OAP) and Cigna PPO plans. Cigna LocalPlus plans are in-network only for members who live in our county; the network area",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2973,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25426513,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2974,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.25147253,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2986,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.25099373,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minutes behind, the front desk will tell you w",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2983,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.2484099,
          "considered": false,
