          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.2482771,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## The self-check-in kiosk\n\nReturning patients can check in at the kiosk beside the front desk instead of queuing. Scan the QR code from your 48-hour reminder text, or ty",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.23822899,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2984,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.23528431,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n## 24-hour blood pressure monitoring\n\nFor ambulatory blood pressure monitoring you wear a cuff on your upper arm, connected to a small recorder on a belt, for 24 ho",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2991,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.23495755,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## Medical procedures\n\n- 93000: resting 12-lead electrocardiogram, with the doctor's reading of it - $65\n- 94010: spirometry - $85\n- 93784: 24-hour ambulatory blo",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2988,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.23393449,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## While you wait\n\nFree guest Wi-Fi is available in the waiting area: the network is called VisitDoc-Guest, and the password is printed on the card at the front desk. Ple",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2982,
          "chunk_index": 5,
          "similarity_score": 0.23277226,
